###> vendored conformance tooling ###
# .ci/ IS committed — deliberately. The conformance script is vendored rather
# than fetched at run time because private/ci is LAN-only, and a fetch that
# fails for a reason nobody notices turns the check into a silent no-op
# (GUIDING-LIGHT §8.2(3)). If it is absent, CI prints a NOTICE and skips.
###< vendored conformance tooling ###
